{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>And they shall scrape the house.</b> From the same root as מקצעות, and likewise in tractates Oholot [the term is] קציעות, and its meaning is splittings. Some say they shall split the corners, but this is not correct, for the plague has already spread in the house; rather, he shall scrape the entire house." "And the meaning of <b>from the house</b> is from the inside." "<b>They shall throw.</b> From the root of קצה, for that part of it which was above was removed separately."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:12.236996878Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}